## 5. Stage gating

| Stage | Goal | Gate |
|-------|------|------|
| **0 (now)** | Spec + epics + stories + failing tests committed | Emperor sign-off on this spec + tests review |
| **1** | Electron shell launches, tray icon, supervises bundled `aw-server` | S1, S5, S6 green |
| **2** | Local UI shows real events from real watchers | S2 green |
| **3** | Cloud sync opt-in, E2EE upload | S3 green |
| **4** | Agent API + SDK + revocation | S4, S7 green |
| **5** | Polish: uninstaller, autoupdate, signed builds | S8 green |

Implementation does NOT begin on a stage until ALL tests for that stage exist and fail meaningfully (i.e., not just `expect(true).toBe(false)`).

